  \cf5 4(m-1)(n-1)\cf2 , pinning both the leading constant and the 
\f2\i order
\f0\i0  of the second-order term with no\
  structural hypothesis. That leaves a factor of about eight against the conjectured \cf5 (m-2)/2\cf2 , and I\
